{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-1",
      "transcript": "He survived an atomic bomb. Three days later, he survived another.",
      "file": "audio/yamaguchi-two-bombs/narration/cue-1.wav",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 4.675,
      "beatIndex": 0,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "yamaguchi-two-bombs.asset.return-home.script.1",
      "samples": 112200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-2",
      "transcript": "This is Tsutomu Yamaguchi, a Mitsubishi shipbuilding engineer.",
      "file": "audio/yamaguchi-two-bombs/narration/cue-2.wav",
      "start": 4.866666666666666,
      "duration": 4.45,
      "beatIndex": 1,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "yamaguchi-two-bombs.asset.return-home.script.2",
      "samples": 106800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-3",
      "transcript": "August sixth, nineteen forty-five. He was in Hiroshima on business when the United States dropped an atomic bomb.",
      "file": "audio/yamaguchi-two-bombs/narration/cue-3.wav",
      "start": 9.5,
      "duration": 7.6,
      "beatIndex": 2,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "yamaguchi-two-bombs.asset.return-home.script.3",
      "samples": 182400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-4",
      "transcript": "Severely burned, he survived.",
      "file": "audio/yamaguchi-two-bombs/narration/cue-4.wav",
      "start": 17.266666666666666,
      "duration": 2.475,
      "beatIndex": 3,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "yamaguchi-two-bombs.asset.return-home.script.4",
      "samples": 59400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-5",
      "transcript": "The next day, he boarded a train. It carried him home to Nagasaki.",
      "file": "audio/yamaguchi-two-bombs/narration/cue-5.wav",
      "start": 20.133333333333333,
      "duration": 4.475,
      "beatIndex": 4,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "yamaguchi-two-bombs.asset.return-home.script.5",
      "samples": 107400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-6",
      "transcript": "On August ninth, he was back at work. He recalled describing Hiroshima to his manager.",
      "file": "audio/yamaguchi-two-bombs/narration/cue-6.wav",
      "start": 27.5,
      "duration": 5.925,
      "beatIndex": 5,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "yamaguchi-two-bombs.asset.return-home.script.6",
      "samples": 142200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-7",
      "transcript": "Then came another flash. The second atomic bomb had struck.",
      "file": "audio/yamaguchi-two-bombs/narration/cue-7.wav",
      "start": 33.8,
      "duration": 4.175,
      "beatIndex": 6,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "yamaguchi-two-bombs.asset.return-home.script.7",
      "samples": 100200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-8",
      "transcript": "He survived again. His wife and infant son survived too.",
      "file": "audio/yamaguchi-two-bombs/narration/cue-8.wav",
      "start": 38.36666666666667,
      "duration": 4.25,
      "beatIndex": 7,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "yamaguchi-two-bombs.asset.return-home.script.8",
      "samples": 102000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-9",
      "transcript": "The bombings killed tens of thousands and left lasting suffering.",
      "file": "audio/yamaguchi-two-bombs/narration/cue-9.wav",
      "start": 42.8,
      "duration": 4.35,
      "beatIndex": 8,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "yamaguchi-two-bombs.asset.return-home.script.9",
      "samples": 104400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-10",
      "transcript": "In two thousand nine, Japan officially recognized his exposure in both cities.",
      "file": "audio/yamaguchi-two-bombs/narration/cue-10.wav",
      "start": 47.53333333333333,
      "duration": 5.6,
      "beatIndex": 9,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "yamaguchi-two-bombs.asset.return-home.script.10",
      "samples": 134400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-11",
      "transcript": "He was not the only double survivor.",
      "file": "audio/yamaguchi-two-bombs/narration/cue-11.wav",
      "start": 53.3,
      "duration": 2.575,
      "beatIndex": 10,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "yamaguchi-two-bombs.asset.return-home.script.11",
      "samples": 61800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-12",
      "transcript": "He lived until twenty ten, aged ninety-three.",
      "file": "audio/yamaguchi-two-bombs/narration/cue-12.wav",
      "start": 56.266666666666666,
      "duration": 3.325,
      "beatIndex": 11,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "yamaguchi-two-bombs.asset.return-home.script.12",
      "samples": 79800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-13",
      "transcript": "In later years, he urged the world to abolish nuclear weapons.",
      "file": "audio/yamaguchi-two-bombs/narration/cue-13.wav",
      "start": 59.766666666666666,
      "duration": 4.225,
